# Runs `podman auto-update` after ANY dnf/dnf5 transaction completes, tying container image
# freshness checks to system package updates (per owner request, 2026-08-03). Harmless if it
# fires more than once per transaction (e.g. many packages updated at once) — podman auto-update
# is a fast no-op when nothing has actually changed. Output logged for visibility/debugging.
*:in:/usr/bin/podman auto-update >> /var/log/podman-auto-update-dnf.log 2>&1
